sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Candidate
  participant API
  participant S as Object storage
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Q as Task queue
  participant W as Worker
  participant L as LLM provider
  C->>API: POST /candidate/resumes (multipart, CSRF)
  API->>API: authn + role, rate limit, size, extension, magic bytes, macro/script checks
  API->>API: malware scan if configured (fails closed)
  API->>S: put(random key, bytes)
  API->>DB: documents + resumes(status=queued), audit
  API->>Q: enqueue process_resume
  API-->>C: 201 resume (queued)
  Q->>W: process_resume(resume_id)
  W->>S: get(bytes)
  W->>W: extract text (pdfplumber / python-docx), OCR only if low text and enabled
  alt AI-processing consent granted
    W->>L: system rules + resume text tagged as untrusted (JSON schema output)
    L-->>W: structured JSON
    W->>W: validate (Pydantic), ground skills in source text, check dates
  else no consent or AI failure
    W->>W: deterministic heuristic extraction
  end
  W->>DB: extracted_profile_facts (stated/inferred + provenance), status=completed
  W->>DB: notification (deduplicated)
  C->>API: GET /candidate/resumes/{id} (review facts)
  C->>API: POST /candidate/resumes/{id}/review {accept, reject}
  API->>DB: user_confirmed profile rows, refresh embedding
